Source basis: Ubuntu 22.04 package gnome-shell-extension-desktop-icons-ng,
desktopManager.js dated 2022-06-28.

This is an unofficial modified copy. The image-drop modifications are in
desktopManager.js, desktopGrid.js and fileItem.js: images dropped on the
desktop or on a folder icon are saved from Firefox's full-resolution image
URL instead of being delegated to Nautilus. See patch/. The right-click
menu addition is in fileItemMenu.js; the standalone viewer is in
viewer/image-canvas. A separate local Nautilus 42.6 URL-drop fix is in
nautilus/.
Verified against Firefox ESR 153.6 on GNOME Shell 42.9.

